        "subject": "={{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.Subject }}",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 600px;\">\n\n  <p>Hi,</p>\n\n  <p>Thank you so much for getting back to me, I really appreciate it and I'd love to continue the conversation.</p>\n\n  <p>To go over the details and see how we can best help you, feel free to book a time that works for you here:</p>\n\n  <p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/EqguYyJWUYn2WmZs6\"\n       style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\">\n      Book a Meeting\n    </a>\n  </p>\n\n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777;\">\n    If the button above doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>\n    <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/EqguYyJWUYn2WmZs6\" style=\"color: #1a73e8;\">https://calendar.app.google/EqguYyJWUYn2WmZs6</a>\n  </p>\n\n  <p>If you have any questions before the call, just reply to this email, I'm happy to help.</p>\n\n  <br><br>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Best regards,</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold;\">Eng. Ahmed</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0; color:#555;\">Senior AI Engineer</p>\n\n</div>",
